{
  "v": 1,
  "note": "Ground truth for the System 1 drafter, written before the harness ran. Delexicalized: requests hold typed slots, `fill` picks each slot from the project's facts by structure (feature#i, library:<kind>#i, item:<feature>/<kind>#i, prop:<item>#i, finding:<RULE>, lit:<neutral test text>), so no project word is stored. `heldOut`: a paraphrase kept out of template design. Gold step args: slot refs, '*' = any value (a handle or a name the drafter makes up). `preferred`: index of the gold route the drafter should recommend, null = any. `defer`: the drafter should hand over to a model or ask; a request that names no item asks one closed question, with the invented name as the one-click answer (owner, 2026-10-11: Train Line's gold wins).",
  "projects": {
    "line-sample": { "dir": "examples/line-sample", "split": "dev" },
    "clinic": { "dir": "examples/line-heldout-clinic", "split": "heldout" }
  },
